Fictional Meridian teaching case No course example grants workplace

00:00:05.468 --> 00:00:11.521
authority Requests and unverified claims are not approvals Compare

00:00:11.573 --> 00:00:15.099
responsibilities and identify the appointed owner for a task

00:00:15.165 --> 00:00:18.955
that goes beyond Daniel’s role Item 4 of 5

00:00:19.007 --> 00:00:21.810
Chief of staff May hold a wider organisational or

00:00:21.863 --> 00:00:26.349
strategic mandate Access to the executive does not confer

00:00:26.415 --> 00:00:29.560
